#29800
"Overgrown Trail Through a Forest"
"A narrow trail cuts through the forest here, diverging from the main

thoroughfare to the west.  Nearby foliage, ferns, grasses, and bushes are

encroaching on the once wider dirt path.  The vegetation is full of leafy

plants in peculiar shades of green.  Bushes boasting grayish violet buds pale

beside the stout, soft-barked trees that stand beside them.  Most of these

tree's branches are at their crowns, creating a thick canopy of olive green

leaves.  Dew rests tranquilly atop much of the greenery.

"
