in an advanced state of decay.  Resting half buried in the glade's high

grasses, the former tree is lacking any limbs or leaves now.  Its insides are

rotting out, its bark is crumbling apart, and remnants of decaying wood powder

the area around it.  Moss covers an entire side, and some can even be seen

within the rotten ends of the poor being.  A shallow @Bpool@n is visible over a

slight rise to the south, while to the west are more high grasses.  Dense

forest bars travel to the east and north.

