#29818
"In a Shallow Pool of Water - Amidst Reeds"
"Standing in a shallow pool of water here are a number of reeds.  The pale

green plants produce timid ripples in the water around them, concentric waves

that dissipate into the surrounding obscurity.  Most of the reeds are

noticeably hollow, but the younger ones are too thin to determine.  Anchored

safely in the muddy ground below, they reach longingly for the sky above.

More water fills this depression to the south and west.  Further to the north,

a decline down the hill leads into the glade's high grasses.

"
