#29826
"The Edge of a Vibrant Glade"
"The colors of the surrounding forest are suspended in the most stunning

display of visual inertia.  Scarlet, vermillion, cobalt, @mviolet@n, and lime

create an optical assault of plant life.  Bushes bristling with vivacious

flowers and trees soaring like @bgeysers@n grow here beside the glade.  The

glade's grasses seem to wither in shame of their banal appearance, in spite of

their own rather peculiar coloration.  In the distance to the north, a spring

bubbles noisily, feeding a shallow pool in the glade.  To the west lies more

of the grassy glade.

