"The Parting Path"
"The trail splits here, leading in three different directions.  Eastward, the

path becomes overgrown by the low lying shrubbery and grasses.  Westward, the

path passes around a boulder that sits in the way of the path to the north.

Southward it passes into what looks like a younger section of the forest with

slightly shorter trees and a floor more clear of debris.  To the south, a vine

hangs low between two trees, hanging across the path.

