#29830
"Trail Alongside a Boulder"
"Wooded slopes descend just off the western edge of this trail as it passes by

an enormous boulder to the east.  Through the heights of trees, the sky waits

like the cupped hands of fate.  The crashing of heavy water carries through

the forest, sending shivers through the ground.  The volume of the far off

noise rises and falls as you pass between the seemingly anechoic trees.  The

trail continues further through the woods to the north and south.

