#29833
"Along a Trail - Distances of Trees"
"Through the limbless depths of mironas you can see countless,

indistinguishable trees against a background of more trees.  Tendrils of vines

dangle from some of the canopy's high branches.  The endless woods form a

canvas of life in the visible distance, upon which the foreground of light and

air paints an invisible picture.  Alongside the trail grows brush and bits of

grass struggling to catch @Ysunlight@n.  Bushes and tangled undergrowth follow the

path north and south.

"
